OL,3,AAirlines criticise air traffic control
OL,4,Aas second glitch causes more disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FAirlines have criticised the UK's air
OL,7,Ftraffic control system after a second
OL,8,Ftechnical problem in two weeks caused
OL,9,Fmajor disruption to UK flights
OL,11,FEasyJet said Monday's incident "once
OL,12,Fagain calls into question the
OL,13,Fresilience" of how the service works,
OL,14,Fwhile Wizz Air said there was a
OL,15,F"national confidence crisis" in
OL,16,FNational Air Traffic Services (Nats),
OL,17,Fwhich runs the UK's air traffic.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
